#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/flir-lepton.rst:88
msgid ""
"This works on individual pixels or on aggregated statistics (e.g. "
"``stats.mean()`` from `Image.get_statistics`) inside an ROI when locating "
"hot/cool regions with `Image.find_blobs`."
msgstr ""
